.TH POKED "1" "March 2025" "GNU poke 4.2-maint-35-gc5886-modified" "User Commands"
.SH "نام (NAME)"
poked \- The poke daemon
.SH "خلاصه دستور (SYNOPSIS)"
.B poked
[\fI\,OPTION\/\fR]...
.SH "توضیحات (DESCRIPTION)"
Daemonized poke interactive editor for binary files.
.TP
\fB\-h\fR, \fB\-\-help\fR
print a help message and exit
.TP
\fB\-v\fR, \fB\-\-version\fR
show version and exit
.TP
\fB\-d\fR, \fB\-\-debug\fR
be more verbose during the execution
.TP
\fB\-S\fR, \fB\-\-socket\-path\fR=\fI\,PATH\/\fR
path of unix domain socket to listen on
.SH "گزارش باگ‌ها (REPORTING BUGS)"
Report bugs in the bug tracker at
.IP
<https://sourceware.org/bugzilla/describecomponents.cgi?product=poke>
or by email to <poke\-devel@gnu.org>.
.PP
